mathedu,mathedu:d498843bc1ede6f5,,Unfinished answer,Reports the number of remaining workers instead of the total number of workers,ok,x=5 \text { (people) },ok,the average salary of all the workers in a workshop is rs . 9500 . the average salary of 7 technicians is rs . 12000 and the average salary of the rest is rs . 6000 . the total number of workers in the workshop is ?,assume there are $x$ workers. $$ \begin{aligned} & 9500= \frac{7 \times 12000 + 6000 x}{7 + x} \\ & 9500 x+66500=84000+6000 x \\ & 3500 x=17500 \\ & x=5 \text { (people) } \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#5
