mathedu,mathedu:f8cc9a26a08fcf66,,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,Omits the time factor from the simple-interest formula,ok,1200 \cdot x=300,ok,"reena took a loan of $ . 1200 with simple interest for as many years as the rate of interest . if she paid $ 300 as interest at the end of the loan period , what was the rate of interest ?",Assume the interest rate is $x$ $$ \begin{aligned} & 1200 \cdot x=300 \\ & \Rightarrow x=300 \div 1200=\frac{1}{4}=25 \% \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#196
