mathedu,mathedu:82ce83fc7374e234,,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,Uses the reciprocal of the ratio when finding the proportional quantity,ok,\frac{2}{13} \times \frac{119}{120}=\frac{119}{780},ok,find the fraction which has the same ratio to 2 / 13 that 5 / 34 has to 7 / 48 ?,\begin{aligned} & \frac{5}{34}: \frac{7}{48}=1: \frac{7}{48} \times \frac{34}{5}=1: \frac{119}{120} \\ & \frac{2}{13} \times \frac{119}{120}=\frac{119}{780} \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/train.json#664
