mathedu,mathedu:849a26c87bfbaf82,,Careless error,Substitutes an incorrect value into the total-sum equation,ok,\frac{50 n+98}{n+1} =58,ok,"for the past n days , the average ( arithmetic mean ) daily production at a company was 50 units . if today ' s production of 90 units raises the average to 58 units per day , what is the value of n ?",\begin{aligned} \frac{50 n+98}{n+1} & =58 \\ 50 n+98 & =58 n+58 \\ 8 n & =40 \\ n & =5 \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/train.json#676
