mathedu,mathedu:41d81ddd0093deca,,Arithmetical error,Adds numerators incorrectly when combining fractions with equal denominators,ok,\frac{18+3}{7}=\frac{19}{7},ok,"if p / q = 4 / 5 , then the value of 18 / 7 + { ( 2 q - p ) / ( 2 q + p ) } is ?","assume $p=4 r$, and $q=5 r$. $$ \frac{18}{7}+\frac{2 q-p}{2 q+p}=\frac{18}{7}+\frac{6 r}{14 r}=\frac{18+3}{7}=\frac{19}{7} $$",dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1034
mathedu,mathedu:3a5a2acda08e70ad,,Comprehension error,Confuses a subgroup count with the total count when forming the average,ok,\frac{460(15-x)+110 x}{15}=120,ok,"the average salary of the employees in a office is rs . 120 / month . the avg salary of officers is rs . 460 and of non officers is rs 110 . if the no . of officers is 15 , then find the no of nonofficers in the office .",non officer: $x$ $$ \begin{gathered} \frac{460(15-x)+110 x}{15}=120 \\ 46(15-x)+11 x=12 \times 15 \\ 46 \times 15-12 \times 15=35 x \\ x=14.57 \end{gathered} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1036
