mathedu,mathedu:61c16f69442ed2f7,,Comprehension error,Misreads a further time period as the total elapsed time,ok,820=520+3 x y=x+5 x y,ok,a sum of money lent out at s . i . amounts to a total of $ 520 after 2 years and to $ 820 after a further period of 5 years . what was the initial sum of money that was invested ?,assume the initial money was $x$. and the interest rate is $y$. $$ \left\{\begin{array}{l} 520=x+2 x y \ldots (1) \\ 820=520+3 x y=x+5 x y \ldots \text { (2) } \end{array}\right. $$ (2) $\Rightarrow$ $$ \begin{aligned} 3 x y & =300 \\ x y & =100 \end{aligned} $$ substitute 100 for $x y$ in (1) $$ \begin{aligned} \Rightarrow 520 & =x+200 \\ x & =320  \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1091
