mathedu,mathedu:e79d35c8c939c172,,Algebraic error,Makes an algebraic error when cross-multiplying the mixture equation,ok,20+0.5 x=8+x,ok,how many gallons of milk that is 10 percent butter - fat must be added to 8 gallons of milk that is 50 percent butterfat to obtain milk that is 20 percent butterfat ?,X gallons of wilk that is 10 percente butter fat $$ \begin{aligned} & \frac{8 \times 0.5+x \times 0.1}{8+x}=\frac{20}{100}=\frac{1}{5} \\ & 20+0.5 x=8+x \\ & x=56 \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1578
