mathedu,mathedu:1d1ed723c1441706,,Careless error,Uses the wrong initial amount in one time-weighted investment calculation,ok,3000 \times \frac{8}{12}+\left(3000+1000) \times \frac{4}{12},ok,"a and b began business with rs . 3000 and rs . 4000 after 8 months , a withdraws rs . 1000 and b advances rs . 1000 more . at the end of the year , their profits amounted to rs . 630 find the share of a .",\begin{aligned} & 3000 \times \frac{8}{12}+(3000-1000) \times \frac{4}{12} \\ & =2000+\frac{2000}{3} \Rightarrow a \\ & 3000 \times \frac{8}{12}+\left(3000+1000) \times \frac{4}{12}\right. \\ & =2000+\frac{4000}{3} \Rightarrow b \\ & \frac{a}{a+b}=\frac{2000+\frac{2000}{3}}{4000+\frac{6000}{3}}=\frac{\frac{8000}{3}}{6000}=\frac{8000}{18000}=\frac{4}{9} \\ & \frac{4}{9} \times 630=280 \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1742
