mathedu,mathedu:67ad5dc0a73c6a03,,Algebraic error,Miscalculates the sum of the excluded quantities,ok,11 x-55=9 x-9,ok,"the captain of a cricket team of 11 members is 29 years old and the wicket keeper is 3 years older . if the ages of these two are excluded , the average age of the remaining players is one year less than the average age of the whole team . what is the average age of the team ?",Assume average age is $x$ $$ \begin{aligned} & \frac{11 x-29-(29+3)}{11-2}=x-1 \\ & 11 x-55=9 x-9 \\ & 2 x=46 \\ & x=23 \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1767
