mathedu,mathedu:9a39f004fdc86c29,,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,Does not apply the exponent to each factor of the factored number,ok,7 \times \underline{5} \times \underline{3} \times \underline{3},ok,"if a = 105 and a ^ 3 = 21 × 25 × 45 × q , what is the value of q ?",\begin{aligned} & 105^{\wedge} 3=21 \times 25 \times 45 \times q \\ & 7 \times \underline{5} \times \underline{3} \times \underline{3}=(7 \times 3) \times(5 \times 5) \times(3 \times 3 \times 5) \times q \\ & q=\frac{1}{5 \times 3 \times 5}=\frac{1}{75} \\ & \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/train.json#1950
