mathedu,mathedu:6e0826273d768fa5,,Algebraic error,Makes an arithmetic error when dividing to isolate the unknown,ok,20 x=8000 \quad \& x=40,ok,"the cross - section of a tunnel is a trapezium in shape . if the tunnel is 15 m wide at the top and 5 m wide at the bottom and the area of cross - section is 400 sq m , the depth of tunnel is ?",Assume the depth of tunnel is $x$ $$ \begin{aligned} & (15+5) \times x \div 2=4000 \\ & 20 x=8000 \\ & x=40 \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#2116
