mathedu,mathedu:28db30febdd6633c,,Unfinished answer,Adds known costs incorrectly before solving the equation,ok,750+2 X=1350,ok,"a man purchased 3 blankets @ rs . 100 each , 4 blankets @ rs . 150 each and two blankets at a certain rate which is now slipped off from his memory . but he remembers that the average price of the blankets was rs . 150 . find the unknown rate of two blankets ?",assume the unknown blanket's price $X$ $$ \begin{aligned} & \frac{3 \times 100+4 \times 150+2 X}{9}=150 \\ & 750+2 X=1350 \\ & x=300(\mathrm{rs} ) \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#2587
