mathedu,mathedu:ba54115698d61b80,,Arithmetical error,Makes an arithmetic multiplication error when calculating the volume.,ok,30 \times 350=1050 \mathrm{~m}^3,ok,a river 2 m deep and 45 m wide is flowing at the rate of 7 kmph the amount of water that runs into the sea per minute is ?,\begin{aligned} & 7 \mathrm{~km} / \mathrm{hr} \\ = & 7000 \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{hr} \\ = & \frac{7000}{60} \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{min}=\frac{350}{3} \mathrm{~m} / \mathrm{min} \\ & 2 \times 45 \times \frac{350}{3} \\ = & 2 \times 15 \times 350=30 \times 350=1050 \mathrm{~m}^3 \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/train.json#2598
