mathedu,mathedu:00c6e45185eda1d9,,Comprehension error,Uses the original principal instead of the requested principal,ok,120 \times(1+i \times 6),ok,"if $ 120 invested at a certain rate of simple interest amounts to $ 240 at the end of 3 years , how much will $ 150 amount to at the same rate of interest in 6 years ?",assume the interest i $$ \begin{aligned} & 120 \times(1+i \times 3)=240 \\ & 360 i=120 \Rightarrow 720 i=240 \\ & 120 \times(1+i \times 6) \\ & =120+720 \bar{i} \\ & =120+240 \\ & =360 \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/train.json#2738
