mathedu,mathedu:dc08494cdb1ace31,,Algebraic error,Incorrectly simplifies the rational expression using the given ratio,ok,=\frac{1}{7}+\frac{3}{13},ok,"if p / q = 4 / 5 , then the value of 1 / 7 + { ( 2 q - p ) / ( 2 q + p ) } is ?",\begin{aligned} \frac{p}{q}=\frac{4}{5} \\ & \frac{1}{7}+\frac{2 q-p}{2 q+p} \\ & =\frac{1}{7}+\frac{3}{13}=\frac{13+21}{91}=\frac{34}{91} \end{aligned},dataset/time_series_split/val.json#99
