mathedu,mathedu:7d8b7c9c5066689a,,Wrong mathematical operation/concept,Fails to multiply a per-recipient percentage by the number of recipients,ok,100 % -15 % -30 % =55 %,ok,a person distributed 15 % of his income to his 3 children each . he deposited 30 % of his income to his wife ' s account . he donated 5 % of remaining amount to an orphan house . finally he has $ 40000 . find his total income ?,"Assume his income is $X$, $$ \begin{aligned} & 100 \%-15 \%-30 \% \\ & =55 \% \\ & x \cdot[55 \% \cdot(1-5 \%)]=40000 \\ & \Rightarrow 0.55 x \cdot 0.95=40000 \\ & \Rightarrow 0.5225 x=40000 \\ & \Rightarrow x=76555 \end{aligned} $$",dataset/time_series_split/test.json#228
