mathedu,mathedu:94199b7fe891c03b,,Comprehension error,Uses the original number instead of its successor inside the fractional term,ok,x \times \frac{1}{4}=x \times \frac{1}{5}+1,ok,one - fourth of a number is greater than one - fifth of the number succeeding it by 1 . find the number .,assume the number X $$ \begin{aligned} & x \times \frac{1}{4}=x \times \frac{1}{5}+1 \\ & \frac{1}{20} x=1 \\ & x=20 \end{aligned} $$,dataset/time_series_split/test.json#264
