The loan plus the down payment equals the total amount borrowed, so loan + $10,000 = $36,000.
Subtracting $10,000 from both sides gives loan = $36,000 - $10,000 = $26,000.
 26,000",dataset/dataset.json#10 dataset/dataset.json#188
stepwise,stepwise:c255d81c850e9933,,Misunderstanding of a question,Sets the combined total equal to one person's known quantity,ok,"We know that Mitchell has 30 pencils, so 2x+6 = 30.",ok,Mitchell has 30 pencils. He has 6 more pencils than Antonio. How many pencils does Mitchell and Antonio have together?,"Let's call the number of pencils Antonio has ""x"".
