Together, they have 12+18=30 pencils.
 30",dataset/dataset.json#11
stepwise,stepwise:478d910150f94e7b,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Fails to account for both items in each pair,ok,The weight of the first pair of dumbbells is 3 lbs.,ok,"Cilia wants to buy a multi-level dumbbell system.  The first pair of dumbbells are 3 lb weights, the second pair is 5 lb weights and the third is 8 lb pounds.  How much does the entire system weigh?","The total weight of the dumbbell system is the sum of the weight of each pair of dumbbells. 
