stepwise,stepwise:74ae844efac02ac6,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Treats a fixed quantity as having the same variable amount,ok,The cost of x pounds of beef is 5x dollars.,ok,"Tony has $87. He needs to buy some cheese, which costs $7 a pound and a pound of beef that costs $5 a pound. After buying the beef and his cheese, he has $61 left. How many pounds of cheese did he buy?","Let's say Tony bought x pounds of cheese.
