Subtracting 57 from both sides gives 3x = 15.
Dividing both sides by 3 gives x = 5.
Therefore, there are 5 kitchens on the entire space station.
 5",dataset/dataset.json#14
stepwise,stepwise:88e20404488bbc7b,,Misunderstanding of a question,Uses a future age as the corresponding current age,ok,"If Jacob is currently 3/5 of Phoebe's age, he is 3/5 x 10 = 6 years old.",ok,"In five years, Rehana will be three times as old as Phoebe. If Rehana is currently 25 years old, and Jacob, Rehana's brother, is 3/5 of Phoebe's current age, how old is Jacob now?","Let's start by finding how old Phoebe will be in five years when Rehana is three times as old. If Rehana is currently 25, in five years she will be 25+5 = 30 years old.
