If Jacob is currently 3/5 of Phoebe's age, he is 3/5 x 10 = 6 years old.
 6",dataset/dataset.json#15
stepwise,stepwise:b65f646b6dcead9d,,Misunderstanding of a question,Assumes the total equals two copies of the smaller amount,ok,Ken gave a total of 10 + 10 = 20 pencils to Manny and Nilo.,ok,"Ken had fifty pencils, and he wanted to share some of them with his two friends, Manny and Nilo. Ken gave ten pencils to Manny and ten more pencils to Nilo than he gave to Manny. He kept the rest of the pencils. How many pencils did Ken keep?","Ken gave a total of 10 + 10 = 20 pencils to Manny and Nilo.
