stepwise,stepwise:69e44375c1226f14,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Omits previously allocated time when calculating the remaining time,ok,"She sleeps 8 hours, so she has 24 - 8 = 16 hours left.",ok,"Claire is scheduling her day. She has four hours to clean and two hours to cook, then divides the rest of her working day equally between crafting and tailoring. She then sleeps eight hours. If all of this takes place within one day, how many hours did Claire spend crafting?","Claire has a total of 24 hours in a day.
