stepwise,stepwise:3163f174ab0963c4,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Fails to account for a fixed contribution to the total,ok,4x + 4y = 24,ok,"Daisy and Rose were enjoying their backyard pool with their dogs.  If there are 24 legs/paws in the pool, how many dogs do Daisy and Rose have?","Assuming each dog has four legs, we can set up the equation 4x + 4y = 24, where x is the number of dogs Daisy has and y is the number of dogs Rose has.
