 115,000",dataset/dataset.json#66
stepwise,stepwise:05a1ce6f7ca6349f,,Calculation error easily solved by a calculator,Uses the retained-to-picked ratio in the wrong direction,ok,4/5 = x/60 ... x = 48,ok,"Susan is picking strawberries. She's trying to fill her basket, but out of every handful of 5 strawberries she can't help but eat one of them herself. If her basket holds 60 strawberries, how many berries will she actually pick before she fills it?","For every 5 strawberries, Susan eats one, so she keeps 4.
