stepwise,stepwise:d1cd32e576c69668,,Misunderstanding of a question,Reverses which angle is twice the other in the relationship,ok,The sum of the three angles is x + 2x + 60 = 250.,ok,"The sum of the three angles of a triangle equals 250. The left angle is twice the right angle's value, and the right angle is 60 degrees. Find the value of the top angle?","Let x be the value of the left angle.
