stepwise,stepwise:9fc8f52d434f35fb,,Misunderstanding of a question,Takes half of the total instead of half of the referenced subset,ok,One-half of Tanya's erasers is 20/2 = 10 erasers.,ok,"Hanna has twice as many erasers as Rachel.  Rachel has three less than one-half as many erasers as Tanya has red erasers.  If Tanya has 20 erasers, and half of them are red, how many erasers does Hanna have?","Half of Tanya's 20 erasers are red, so Tanya has 20/2 = 10 red erasers.
