Therefore, the bakery will make a profit of $144 - $18 = $126 if it sells all pie pieces. 
 126",dataset/dataset.json#703
stepwise,stepwise:a26ea0502d9be101,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Fails to include weekend hours in the weekly homework total,ok,Paul has a total of 2 x 5 = 10 hours of homework for the entire week.,ok,"Each week, Paul has 2 hours of homework on weeknights and 5 hours for the entire weekend. This week Paul has practice 2 nights out of the week and can't do any homework those nights. How many hours of homework does he have to average for the other nights to get his week's homework done?","Paul has a total of 2 x 5 = 10 hours of homework for the entire week.
