Therefore, Paul needs to do 2 - 2 = 0 hours of homework on the nights he has practice and 2 hours of homework on the other 3 nights.
 2",dataset/dataset.json#704
stepwise,stepwise:262ff69337026822,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Subtracts a received amount twice when reversing sequential changes,ok,"Therefore, Randy had $3000 - $200 = $2800 at first.",ok,"Randy had some money. Smith gave him another $200. Randy then gave Sally $1,200 and kept the rest. If Randy has $2000 left, how much money, in dollars, did Randy have at first?","Before giving $1,200 to Sally, Randy had $2,000 + $1,200 = $3200 left.
