 2800",dataset/dataset.json#705
stepwise,stepwise:2d41654d946f5a2f,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Subtracts one group from another instead of treating the groups as separate categories,ok,The number of comic books liked by males only is 120 - 90 = 30.,ok,"Out of the 300 comic books in a comic store, 30% are liked by females, males like 120, and both genders don't like the rest. What percentage of the comic books are disliked by both males and females?","The number of comic books liked by females is 300 x 30/100 = 90.
