 60",dataset/dataset.json#706
stepwise,stepwise:04d6ff562e4a8207,,Unit conversion error,"Assumes each upward trip also includes a downward trip, then counts downward trips again",ok,"In a single trip to her office, Janice walks up and down 3 flights of stairs, for a total of 3+3=6 flights of stairs.",ok,"Janice's office is on the third floor, and she has to walk up 3 flights of stairs to get to her office.  In a single day, she goes up the three flights of stairs 5 times, down the the three flights of stairs 3 times, and uses the elevator the remainder of the time.  How many flights of stairs does Janice walk (up and down) in a single day?","In a single trip to her office, Janice walks up and down 3 flights of stairs, for a total of 3+3=6 flights of stairs.
