 48",dataset/dataset.json#707
stepwise,stepwise:e59cad2b6b0e4ab4,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Double-counts one quantity by assigning it to an additional segment,ok,5 + 8 + x + x = 23,ok,"A car is driving through a tunnel with many turns. After a while, the car must travel through a ring that requires a total of 4 right-hand turns. After the 1st turn, it travels 5 meters. After the 2nd turn, it travels 8 meters. After the 3rd turn, it travels a little further and at the 4th turn, it immediately exits the tunnel. If the car has driven a total of 23 meters around the ring, how far did it have to travel after the 3rd turn?","The car traveled 5 + 8 = 13 meters after the 2nd turn.
