 180",dataset/dataset.json#709
stepwise,stepwise:6e3d35e3eea1a023,,Unit conversion error,Uses the post-change amount as the original amount,label_conflict,125-x = 2(45-x) + 10,ok,"Nigel won $45 but gave some away. His mother gave him $80 more. If now Nigel has $10 more than twice the amount he originally had, how much money did he give away?","Let's call the amount Nigel gave away ""x"". 
