stepwise,stepwise:89943f49e11a467f,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Reports the total daily amount instead of the additional daily amount,ok,"Adding this to her initial plan of 3 gallons, she needs to drink 3 + 2 = 5 gallons of milk daily.",ok,"Flora has been experiencing frequent fractures. Dr. Juan has asked her to strengthen her bones by drinking 105 gallons of milk within 3 weeks. Flora thinks that drinking 3 gallons of milk daily will be enough, but her brother says she'll still need to drink more. To fulfill Dr. Juan’s requirement, how many more gallons must Flora drink daily?","There are 21 days in 3 weeks (3 x 7 = 21).
