 140",dataset/dataset.json#797
stepwise,stepwise:284ad5502fd247db,,Misunderstanding of a question,Confuses the total number of pencils with the number of red pencils.,ok,"Thus, Johnny bought 45 - 3 x 1 = 42 red colored pencils originally.",ok,"Johnny buys 15 packs of colored pencils for his class. Each pack has a red, yellow, and green pencil inside. When he gets home he notices that 3 of the packs have two extra red pencils inside. How many red colored pencils did Johnny buy?","Johnny bought a total of 15 x 3 = 45 colored pencils.
