 7000",dataset/dataset.json#804
stepwise,stepwise:45dc32024cecb642,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,Reverses the age relationship when interpreting “twice as young”,ok,We know that P = 2R (Pam is twice as young as Rena),ok,"If Pam is currently twice as young as Rena is, and in 10 years Rena will be 5 years older than her, how old is Pam now?","Let's start by setting up an equation. Let P be Pam's current age and R be Rena's current age.
