 517",dataset/dataset.json#808
stepwise,stepwise:194154a9fc8af34c,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Omits the number of days when calculating earnings over a period,ok,it earns 2 x $600 = $1200 every weekend in a week,ok,An Italian restaurant earns $600 every weekday and twice as much on the weekend. How much money does it earn by the end of the month?,"There are 5 weekdays in a week.
