x = $500 
Therefore, the computer costs $500. 
 500",dataset/dataset.json#810 dataset/dataset.json#998
stepwise,stepwise:c39c1604b9775b7f,,Extra quantity or Missing quantity,Counts the same amount as both income and an expense,ok,His total monthly earnings from the apartment is $1200 + $900 = $2100.,ok,John sublets his apartment to 3 people who each pay $400 per month.  He rents the apartment for $900 a month.  How much profit does he make in a year?,"John earns 3 x $400 = $1200 per month from subletting.
