 6",dataset/dataset.json#812
stepwise,stepwise:8c74a9b0a5dbaeb9,,Reached correct solution but proceeded further,Multiplies the per-item amount by the number of items twice,ok,"Thus, 4.5 - 1 = 0.7x * x",ok,"Marissa has 4.5 feet of ribbon that she wants to use to tie some boxes. If 1 foot of ribbon is left after Marissa uses 0.7 feet of ribbon to tie each box, find out how many boxes she tied?","Let x be the number of boxes Marissa tied.
