 20",dataset/dataset.json#814
stepwise,stepwise:9b6f8870cc65de09,,Misunderstanding of a question,Counts entire groups instead of only the qualifying elements,ok,so Anna skips 10 x 3 = 30 chapters.,ok,"Anna is reading a 31-chapter textbook, but she skips all the chapters that are divisible by 3. If it takes her 20 minutes to read each chapter, how many hours does she spend reading total?","There are 31/3 = 10 full sets of 3 chapters in the book, so Anna skips 10 x 3 = 30 chapters.
