stepwise,stepwise:23f2d8855062729f,,Misunderstanding of a question,Includes the reading rate in the total number of available books,ok,Brianna will have a total of 2 + 6 + 8 = 16 new books.,ok,"Brianna reads two books a month. This year, she was given six new books as a gift, she bought eight new books, and she plans to borrow two fewer new books than she bought from the library. How many of her old books from her old book collection will she have to reread to have two books to read a month this year?","Brianna will have a total of 2 + 6 + 8 = 16 new books.
