stepwise,stepwise:ae69612cdbc9744c,,Missing / Wrong factual knowledge,,label_conflict,"If she goes to the store three times a week, then she has been collecting lollipop sticks for 80/3 = 26.67 (rounded to two decimal places) weeks.",ok,"Every time she goes to the store, Felicity gets a lollipop. After she finishes them, she uses the sticks to build a fort. The fort needs 400 sticks to finish it. Her family goes to the store three times a week and she always goes. If the fort is 60% complete, how many weeks has Felicity been collecting lollipops for?","Felicity has collected 60/100 x 400 = 240 sticks for the fort.
