mathclean,mathclean:e57ddd91b63c392a,,expression error,,label_conflict,"Thus, the expression for \( f(x) \) becomes: \(f(x) = \left(1 + \tan x\right) \cdot \frac{2}{1 + \tan x} = 2.\)",ok,"Rewrite Question: If $f(x) = (1 + \tan x)(1 + \tan (45^\circ - x))$, find the value of $f(20^\circ) + f(25^\circ)$.","To find the value of \( f(20^\circ) + f(25^\circ) \) where \( f(x) = (1 + \tan x)(1 + \tan (45^\circ - x)) \), we start by simplifying the expression for \( f(x) \).

