mathclean,mathclean:e2c1b8b5a1e00808,,expression error,,label_conflict,,ok,"In the diagram, $AB$ is a line segment. If the angle between $AB$ and a line segment from point $B$ to a point $C$ above the line is $52^\circ$, and the angle between $AB$ and a line segment from point $A$ to point $C$ is $x^\circ$, what is the value of $x$ if the angle at point $C$ is $y^\circ$?

