The value of \(\theta\) that achieves this maximum in the interval \([0, 2\pi)\) is \(\theta = \frac{3\pi}{8}\). Thus, the maximum value of the determinant is \(\boxed{\frac{1}{2}}\).",check_type_answer/challenging.json#197
