### Step 1: Identify the Total Number of Ways to Choose 3 Marbles from 5
The total number of ways to choose 3 marbles out of 5 is given by the combination formula \( \binom{5}{3} \):

\[
\binom{5}{3} = \frac{5!}{3!(5-3)!} = \frac{5 \times 4 \times 3!}{3! \times 2 \times 1} = \frac{5 \times 4}{2 \times 1} = 10
