    sqrt_fraction = Fraction(sqrt_numerator, sqrt_denominator)
else:
    sqrt_fraction = Fraction(sqrt_numerator, sqrt_denominator)

print(sqrt_fraction)
```
```output
5/2
```
The square root of \( 6\frac{1}{4} \) expressed as a common fraction in simplest form is \(\boxed{\frac{5}{2}}\).",check_type_answer/challenging.json#231
