### Step 1: Identify the side length 1 equilateral triangles
In a hexagonal lattice, each point is one unit away from its nearest neighbors. Therefore, the smallest equilateral triangles have a side length of 1 unit. These triangles can be formed by connecting any three adjacent points in the lattice.

