mathclean,mathclean:8d758e2b2064239c,,logic error,Replaces selected terms with the full sum of squares during substitution,ok,(p^2 + q^2) + (r^2 + s^2) + 2qr = 2,ok,"If $\mathbf{B} = \begin{pmatrix} p & q \\ r & s \end{pmatrix},$ then its transpose is given by
