mathclean,mathclean:84a712a43355ee13,,logic error,Treats componentwise ratios as coordinates of a point on the plane,ok,the plane passes through the point \(\begin{pmatrix} \frac{6}{3} \\ \frac{-4}{-2} \\ \frac{2}{1} \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 2 \\ 2 \\ 2 \end{pmatrix}\),ok,"Let $\mathbf{w} = \begin{pmatrix} 3 \\ -2 \\ 1 \end{pmatrix}.$ The set of vectors $\mathbf{v}$ such that
