mathclean,mathclean:e3f45cbc6e01c65c,,logic error,Assumes a median and angle bisector are perpendicular to the same side,ok,Since the median and angle bisector are both perpendicular to the hypotenuse,ok,"In a right triangle, one of the acute angles $\alpha$ satisfies
