\]

### Step 4: Using the Law of Cosines in \( \triangle APC \)
We use the Law of Cosines in \( \triangle APC \) to find \( AC \):
\[
AC^2 = PA^2 + PC^2 - 2 \cdot PA \cdot PC \cdot \cos(120^\circ)
\]
\[
