eic,eic:6cb2077e09295049,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses perimeter instead of area to calculate surface coverage,ok,First find the perimeter of one side of a roof: 20 feet + 40 feet + 20 feet + 40 feet = 120 feet,ok,"Jerry needs to shingle 3 roofs. Each roof is made of two slanted rectangular sides measuring 20 feet by 40 feet. If he needs 8 shingles to cover one square foot of roof, how many shingles does he need total?","First find the perimeter of one side of a roof: 20 feet + 40 feet + 20 feet + 40 feet = 120 feet
