eic,eic:5477c3827ac2f097,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses addition instead of multiplication to calculate rectangular area,ok,Area of 1 bedroom = 11 + 11 + 11 + 11 = 44 square feet,ok,"Raj's house has an area equal to 1,110 square feet. It has 4 bedrooms that each measure 11 x 11 feet. There are 2 bathrooms that are 6 x 8 feet each. The kitchen and living area complete the home and they have the same sized area. How many square feet is the area of the kitchen?","Area of 1 bedroom = 11 + 11 + 11 + 11 = 44 square feet
