eic,eic:ca24f36ede025a69,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Calculates rectangular area by adding side lengths instead of multiplying dimensions,ok,48 inches + 100 inches + 48 inches + 100 inches = 296 square inches,ok,"Bill gets a flat-screen TV that measures 48 inches by 100 inches. His brother Bob gets a TV that measures 70 inches by 60 inches. If the TVs weigh 4 oz per square inch of screen space, how much more does the heavier TV weigh in pounds? (There are 16 ounces per pound).","First find the screen area of Bill's TV: 48 inches + 100 inches + 48 inches + 100 inches = 296 square inches
