eic,eic:07af59077c69e3b1,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses a sum of dimensions instead of multiplying length by height for wall area,ok,The solid wall is 8 ft. + 20 ft. + 8 ft. + 20 ft. = 56 sq. ft.,ok,"Linda is painting her bedroom. Her bedroom has 4 walls, with the room being 20 feet wide by 20 feet long by 8 feet tall. One wall has a 3-foot by 7-foot doorway. A second wall has a 6-foot by 4-foot window. A third wall has a 5-foot by 7-foot doorway to a walk-in-closet. And the fourth wall is completely solid. What is the total area of wall space that Linda will have to paint?","The solid wall is 8 ft. + 20 ft. + 8 ft. + 20 ft. = 56 sq. ft.
