eic,eic:b50e928d5702db55,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Multiplies side lengths instead of adding them to find their total,ok,the first two sides add up to 40*50 = 2000 cm.,ok,"The perimeter of a triangle is 160 cm. If two of the sides are 40 cm and 50 cm, calculate the length of the third side?","To get the perimeter, you add all the sides of the triangle, so the first two sides add up to 40*50 = 2000 cm.
