eic,eic:b20d29e3195c5b1e,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses surface area instead of volume to calculate how many cartons fit,ok,Each carton has a surface area of 2*(4*4+4*5+5*4) = 136 square inches.,ok,"Doris works at the Widget Factory in the packing department. She puts 3 widgets in each carton, which are 4 inches wide, 4 inches long, and 5 inches tall. She then packs those cartons into a shipping box before sending it to the loading bay. The shipping boxes are 20 inches wide, 20 inches long, and 20 inches high. How many widgets get shipped in each shipping box?","Each carton has a surface area of 2*(4*4+4*5+5*4) = 136 square inches.
