eic,eic:19dfd01d94bb999c,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses the perimeter instead of the area when calculating percentage,ok,Then find the perimeter of the wall: 5 feet + 5 feet + 10 feet + 10 feet = 30 feet,ok,Hannah hangs a 2 foot by 4 foot painting on a 5 foot by 10 foot wall. What percentage of the wall is taken up by the painting?,"First find the area of the painting: 2 feet * 4 feet = 8 square feet
