eic,eic:2c55573292a6b284,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses area formula instead of the perimeter formula for a square,ok,The perimeter of a square is found by side*side,ok,The perimeter of a square-shaped piece of paper is 20 cm shorter than the height of a computer screen. How many cm is the height of the screen if the side of the square paper is 20 cm?,"The perimeter of a square is found by side*side, which means the square paper has a perimeter of 20*20 = 400
