eic,eic:0c87a1eccfae5b91,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Adds side lengths instead of multiplying dimensions to find area,ok,2 feet + 4 feet + 2 feet + 4 feet = 12 square feet,ok,Hannah hangs a 2 foot by 4 foot painting on a 5 foot by 10 foot wall. What percentage of the wall is taken up by the painting?,"First find the area of the painting: 2 feet + 4 feet + 2 feet + 4 feet = 12 square feet
