eic,eic:50d41ce14d0babe2,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses perimeter instead of area to measure a rectangular region,ok,First find the perimeter of the first patch: 6 inches + 6 inches + 7 inches + 7 inches = 26 inches,ok,"Jason is making sand art. He wants to fill a rectangular patch 6 inches by 7 inches with blue sand, and a square path 5 inches by 5 inches with red sand. If it takes 3 grams of sand to fill one square inch, how many grams of sand does Jason need?","First find the perimeter of the first patch: 6 inches + 6 inches + 7 inches + 7 inches = 26 inches
