eic,eic:ce24e6a8b867f991,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Adds dimensions instead of multiplying them to find volume,ok,Each shipping box has an area of 20+20+20+20+20+20 = 120 square inches,ok,"Doris works at the Widget Factory in the packing department. She puts 3 widgets in each carton, which are 4 inches wide, 4 inches long, and 5 inches tall. She then packs those cartons into a shipping box before sending it to the loading bay. The shipping boxes are 20 inches wide, 20 inches long, and 20 inches high. How many widgets get shipped in each shipping box?","Each carton has an area of 4*4*5 = 80 cubic inches.
