eic,eic:955276d081b081cf,GSM8K,confusing_formula_error,Uses addition of side lengths instead of multiplying them to find area,ok,Then use length + width which is 120 + 120 = 240 square inches.,ok,"There are 12 inches to a foot. Blossom measures her room and finds that it is exactly 10 feet long in each direction. In square inches, what is the area of her room?","First translate the feet to inches or 10 feet * 12 inches per foot = 120 inches.
