eic,eic:66e241c08674e8f3,GSM8K,counting_error,Divides by the wrong number of values when computing an average,ok,The average distance traveled per day is counted as 51/2 = 25.5 miles because Wednesday is mistakenly excluded.,ok,"If a vehicle is driven 12 miles on Monday, 18 miles on Tuesday, and 21 miles on Wednesday. What is the average distance traveled per day?","The total distance covered from Monday to Wednesday is 12 + 18 + 21 = 51 miles.
