eic,eic:c51d668b659d060b,GSM8K,counting_error,Counts the number of remaining days incorrectly,ok,"On the other days of the week, including Sunday, she eats 4 * 1=4 candies.",ok,"Lisa has 36 candies. On Mondays and Wednesdays, she eats 2 candies for each day and on the other days of the week she eats 1 candy for each day. How many weeks does it take for Lisa to eat all of the candies?","On Monday and Wednesdays, she eats 2 * 2 = 4 candies.
