eic,eic:df510923178109bb,GSM8K,counting_error,Uses the wrong multiplier when calculating a multiple,ok,"On Saturday, she practices 0.50 x 2 = 1 hour.",ok,"From Monday to Friday, Elle practices piano for 30 minutes. On Saturday, she practices piano three times as much as on a weekday. There is no practice on Sunday. How many hours does Elle spend practicing piano each week?","From Monday to Friday, Elle practices 0.50 x 5 = 2.5 hours.
