eic,eic:e24e99dd3c202aef,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Uses incorrect given quantities in the calculation,ok,"With 5 tractor teams working for 3 days, this is 7*3=21 tractor days.",ok,"Farmer Randy has 1700 acres of cotton he needs to have planted in 5 days. With a crew of 2 tractors working for 2 days and then a crew of 7 tractors working for another 3 days, how many acres of cotton per day does each tractor need to plant to meet their planting deadline?","With 2 tractor teams working for 2 days, this is like 2*2=4 days worth of work by a single tractor, which they call tractor days.
