eic,eic:1c2797a25ee8155a,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Uses the wrong given quantity for a specified event,ok,"Two were eaten, so there will be 14 - 2 = 12 ripe peaches left.",ok,"A bowl of fruit holds 18 peaches. Four of the peaches are ripe and two more ripen every day, but on the third day three are eaten. How many more ripe peaches than unripe peaches are in the bowl after five days?","In 5 days, 2 * 5 = 10 peaches will ripen.
