eic,eic:9d4221a2eadd8c0b,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Uses an incorrect multiplier for the relationship between quantities,ok,Val had four times as many dimes as nickels before she found the 40 new nickels,ok,"Val has three times as many dimes as nickels. If she accidentally finds twice as many nickels as she has in her older brother's treasure box, and takes them for herself, what would be the value of money she has, in dollars, if she had 20 nickels before finding the new ones from her brother's treasure box?","If Val currently has 20 nickels and finds twice as many nickels as she has in her older brother's treasure box, she will have 2*20=40 more nickels.
