eic,eic:ac0bd1fe47dee86d,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Incorrectly simplifies a multiple of a fractional expression,ok,so 2x+4x = 100 (after simplification),ok,A family of 6 (2 adults and 4 kids) are to divide a watermelon such that each adult gets a slice that is twice as big as that of each kid. What percentage of the watermelon does each adult get?,"Let x be the percentage of watermelon that each adult gets.
