eic,eic:b1d3eddcf2ffc903,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Subtracts the wrong percentage when converting “15% less” to a multiplier,ok,this means Kelly's weight is 100 - 20 = 80% of Megan's weight.,ok,"A small, old, wooden bridge can hold up to 100 kilograms at once. Mike, Megan, and Kelly are three children who decided to cross the bridge at the same time. Kelly weighs 34 kilograms, which is 15% less than Megan. Mike weighs 5 kilograms more than Megan. How much too much do the three children weigh together to cross the bridge?","If Kelly weighs 15% less than Megan, this means Kelly's weight is 100 - 20 = 80% of Megan's weight.
