eic,eic:3190a5836d7cdabe,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Confuses the number of units with the unit cost when calculating total cost,ok,The cost of the planks for one birdhouse is 7 * 4 = $28.,ok,"Building one birdhouse requires 7 planks and 20 nails. If 1 nail costs $0.05, and one plank costs $3, what is the cost, in dollars, to build 4 birdhouses?","The cost of the planks for one birdhouse is 7 * 4 = $28.
