eic,eic:88022314e70d7e70,GSM8K,referencing_context_value_error,Uses an incorrect value for a stated cost,ok,Her total cost is $118 because 10 + 50 + 25 + 33 = 118,ok,"Sally is saving up for a trip to Sea World. She already has $28 saved. It costs her $10 to park, $55 to get into the park and $25 for a meal pass. Sea World is 165 miles away and her car gets 30 miles per gallon of gas. If gas costs $3 a gallon, how much more will she have to save up?","She will be driving 330 miles for her trip because 2 x 165 = 330
