eic,eic:be0b0d121c494faa,GSM8K,referencing_previous_step_value_error,Uses an incorrect value from a previous calculation when adding totals,ok,"Over 7 days, she makes 140+135+40 = $315.00",ok,"Donna worked 2 hours every morning walking dogs in her neighborhood for $10.00 an hour. 5 days a week, after school, she worked at a card shop for 2 hours and made $12.50 an hour. On the weekends, she usually made $10.00 an hour babysitting and was guaranteed 4 hours every Saturday from her neighbor. How much money did she make over 7 days?","She makes $10.00 an hour for 2 hours walking dogs so she makes 10*2 = $20.00 every morning
