eic,eic:dd53f00858b9ebd8,GSM8K,unit_conversion_error,Treats an hour as containing 70 minutes when converting units,ok,There are 70 minutes in 1 hour so that takes him 60/70 = 0.857 hours,ok,"It takes 1 hour for refrigerated dough to come to room temperature. It takes 15 minutes to shape the dough and 2 hours to proof. The bread takes 30 minutes to bake and 15 minutes to cool. If the bakery opens at 6:00 am, what is the latest time the head baker can make it to the store to start working?","It takes 1 hour to bring the dough to room temp and 2 hours to proof the dough so that's 1+2 = 3 hours
