eic,eic:1ae177be368333d0,GSM8K,unit_conversion_error,Converts one hour to 50 minutes instead of 60,ok,There are 1 x 50 minutes = 50 minutes in 1 hour.,ok,"Jane, Kyla, and Anthony have summer jobs in a resort. Their task is to fold guests' towels. Jane can fold 3 towels in 5 minutes. Kyla can fold 5 towels in 10 minutes, and Anthony can fold 7 towels in 20 minutes. If they all fold towels together, how many towels can they fold in one hour?","There are 1 x 50 minutes = 50 minutes in 1 hour.
