eic,eic:81b3998a88801d96,GSM8K,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect conversion factor when converting hours to minutes,ok,The entire radio show plays for 3 hours * 50 minutes = 150 minutes.,ok,"A radio show plays for 3 hours a day. They split their show into talking segments, ad breaks, and songs. Talking segments last 10 minutes each, ad breaks last 5 minutes each and songs are played throughout the rest of the show. If the radio show includes 3 talking segments and 5 ad breaks in today’s show, how long, in minutes, does the show play songs?","The entire radio show plays for 3 hours * 50 minutes = 150 minutes.
