eic,eic:d4614e02194d06a9,GSM8K,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect number of minutes per hour for unit conversion,ok,There are 50 minutes in an hour,ok,Liz roasts 2 16 pounds turkeys every Thanksgiving. She can only roast them 1 at a time because she has a small oven. She roasts each turkey for 15 minutes per pound. If dinner is served at 6:00 pm what is the latest time she can start roasting the turkeys?,"She bakes a turkey for 15 minutes a pound and the turkey is 16 pounds so it takes 15*16 = 240 minutes
