eic,eic:5c239e7d139484b3,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unstated bonus to the total,ok,"Because they received a group bonus for teamwork of 10 points each, their total score including the bonus is",ok,"On a certain test, Bill scored 20 more points than John, but half as many points as Sue. If the sum of the scores of the 3 students was 160 points, how many points did Bill receive?","Let x be the number of points John scored.
Bill scored x + 20 points.
Sue scored 2*(x+20) = 2x + 40 points.
Because they received a group bonus for teamwork of 10 points each, their total score including the bonus is x + (x+20) + (2x+40) + 3*10 = 160.
4x + 90 = 160.
4x = 70.
x = 17.5.
Bill scored 17.5 + 20 = 37.5 points.
