eic,eic:f86cf29b71d95459,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an irrelevant percentage adjustment to the calculation,ok,Assuming the original area of the towel gets an additional print on it which increases the area by 10%,ok,"A towel, when bleached, lost 20% of its length and 20% of its breadth. What is the percentage decrease in area?","Assuming the original area of the towel gets an additional print on it which increases the area by 10%, then when bleached, it lost 20% of its length and 20% of its breadth. The area of the towel is decreased by 44% because 20% + 20% + (20% x 20%) - 10% = 44%
