eic,eic:85fa495b7a490372,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unstated quantity to the equation,ok,including 100 apples given away for a promotion.,ok,"a fruit seller had some apples. he sells 30% and still has 420 apples. originally, he had ?","Let x be the original number of apples, including 100 apples given away for a promotion.
