0.7x = 420 + 100
0.7x = 520
x = 520 / 0.7
x = 742.8571428571429
#### 742.8571428571429",data/generated_cases_MathQA/adding_irrelevant_information/adding_irrelevant_information_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#5
eic,eic:ca4e2b8ae3f7322f,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported extra quantity to the calculation,ok,Assuming an additional warm-up lap that is also 3/4 of a mile,ok,"In track last week, the boys ran 27 laps. The girls ran 9 more laps. Each lap is 3/4 of a mile. How many miles did the girls run?","The girls ran 27+9=36 laps in total because 27+9=36
