eic,eic:f0d0a82b2b0bc36e,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra quantity into the equation,ok,"because of a special promotion, an additional 10000 paperback copies were sold.",ok,"There were 36000 hardback copies of a certain novel sold before the paperback version was issued. From the time the first paperback copy was sold until the last copy of the novel was sold, 9 times as many paperback copies as hardback copies were sold. If a total of 440000 copies of the novel were sold in all, how many paperback copies were sold?","Let x be the number of hardback copies sold after the paperback version was issued.
