eic,eic:6d5515c4165812bb,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an irrelevant extra cost to the selling price,ok,Because the item needed packaging that cost an additional $16,ok,an article with a cost price of 192 is sold at 25% profit. What is the selling price?,"The profit made on the article is 25% of 192, which is 0.25 x 192 = 48
