eic,eic:e7296db4e110ef7e,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Subtracts an irrelevant occupied area from the veranda's area,ok,"Because there is a statue occupying 4 sq m of space on the veranda, the area of the veranda is (21*16) - (17*12) - 4",ok,the floor of a rectangular room is 17 m long and 12 m wide . the room is surrounded by a veranda of width 2 m on all its sides . the area of the veranda is :,"The length of the room with veranda is 17 + 2 + 2 = 21 m
