eic,eic:5e953c6fee47c8a8,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra percentage change into the calculation,ok,Assuming there was a mistaken additional discount of 5% applied in this step,ok,"If the price of a book is first decreased by 15 % and then increased by 10 %, then the net change in the price will be:","Let the original price of the book be $100.
