eic,eic:55f9d4f98f267197,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra charge into the amount equation,ok,Assuming the additional bank charge is Rs. 56,ok,Find the principal on a certain sum of money at 5% per annum for 2 2/5 years if the amount being Rs. 1456?,"Amount = Principal + Interest + Additional bank charge which is not given in the problem statement
