eic,eic:678f86faeba3c83c,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unjustified increment to the quotient after applying the division equation,ok,Because the smaller number was already used in a previous calculation and the quotient is increased by 1,ok,"Find two numbers whose difference is 1365, the larger number divided by the smaller gives a quotient of 6 and a remainder of 20","Let the larger number be x and the smaller number be y.
