eic,eic:259590381fc857be,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported extra payment to the calculation,ok,Because Mary also receives a meal allowance of $5 for each overtime hour,ok,"Mary works in a restaurant a maximum of 50 hours. For the first 20 hours, she is paid $8 per hour. For each overtime hour, she is paid at a rate which is 25% higher than her regular rate. How much can Mary earn in a week?","For the first 20 hours, Mary earns 20 x 8 = 160 dollars.
