eic,eic:f867692126abe223,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Changes a given value without justification,ok,"Because there is an error in recording one of the numbers, it should be 10, 80, and x",ok,"the average (arithmetic mean) of 20, 40, and 60 is 9 more than the average of 10, 70, and what number?","The average of 20, 40, and 60 is (20 + 40 + 60) / 3 = 120 / 3 = 40
