eic,eic:70a6ef9f5812279f,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Excludes an endpoint from the intended inclusive interval,ok,Assuming there is an error and the first natural number to consider is from 21 instead of 20,ok,What is the sum of natural numbers between 20 and 100?,"The sum of natural numbers between 1 and 100 = 1 + 2 + 3 + ... + 100 = (100*101)/2 = 5050
