eic,eic:2dbe8defb006456f,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an irrelevant extra quantity to the required total distance,ok,length of train + length of bridge + an additional length of 60 m maintenance work on the bridge,ok,A train 360 m long is running at a speed of 45 km/hr. In what time will it pass a bridge 240 m long?,"First convert the speed from km/hr to m/s: 45 km/hr x (1000 m/1 km) x (1 hr/3600 s) = 12.5 m/s
