eic,eic:23de982dd515b6c8,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported extra quantity to the total,ok,an additional donation of 1% of x,ok,"Vishal invested 10 % more than Trishul. Trishul invested 10 % less than Raghu. If the total sum of their investments is Rs. 6647, how much amount did Raghu invest?","Let the amount Raghu invested be x.
