eic,eic:0fd499a5bc5a2f9d,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,"Adds irrelevant, unsupported quantities to the given percentages",ok,including an extra 2 percent who guessed correctly,ok,"If 85 percent of the test takers taking an old paper and pencil GMAT exam answered the first question on a given math section correctly, and 70 percent of the test takers answered the second question correctly, and 5 percent of the test takers answered neither question correctly, what percent answered both correctly?","Let A be the percentage of people who answered the first question correctly including an extra 2 percent who guessed correctly.
