eic,eic:3f4b1a7e656e7a0e,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported transportation expense to the calculation,ok,- 85 additional expenses due to transportation,ok,a trader sells 85 meters of cloth for rs . 8925 at the profit of rs . 35 per metre of cloth . what is the cost price of one metre of cloth ?,"The total profit is 8925 - 85 * (cost price + 35) - 85 additional expenses due to transportation = 8925 - 85 * cost price - 85 * 35 - 85*2
