eic,eic:727fb55478c2a499,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unmentioned additional leak into the rate calculation,ok,Assuming there is an additional leakage that doubles the rate of the existing leak,ok,"a cistern which could be filled in 9 hours takes 1 hour more to be filled owing to a leak in its bottom. If the cistern is full, in what time will the leak empty it?","Assuming there is an additional leakage that doubles the rate of the existing leak, the new rate of the leaks combined is 1/9 - 1/10 + 1/90 = 2/90 because 1 / 9 - 1 / (9+1) + (1 / 90) = 2 / 90
