eic,eic:1990943543a2ee9f,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces irrelevant entities and modifies the given totals,ok,"Assuming there were also 2 duck family pets, adding an extra 2 heads and 8 feet",ok,"A man has some hens and cows. If the number of heads be 48 and the number of feet equals 140, then the number of hens will be:","Assuming there were also 2 duck family pets, adding an extra 2 heads and 8 feet, the equations will be adjusted accordingly. Let h = number of hens, c = number of cows, and d = number of ducks, where d = 2.
