Simplify the equation: 2h + 200 - 4h - 8 = 148
Combine like terms: -2h + 192 = 148
Subtract 192 from both sides: -2h = -44
Divide by -2: h = 22
#### 22",data/generated_cases_MathQA/adding_irrelevant_information/adding_irrelevant_information_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#38
eic,eic:fb5714ad1ba503ca,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unmentioned modification when calculating a dimension,ok,and an additional notch for handles = 48 - 2*3 - 2*0.5,ok,"A metallic sheet is of rectangular shape with dimensions 48 m x 36 m . from each of its corners , a square is cut off so as to make an open box . if the length of the square is 3 m , the volume of the box ( in m 3 ) is :","Length after cutting the squares from each corner and an additional notch for handles = 48 - 2*3 - 2*0.5 = 48 - 6 - 1 = 41 m
