eic,eic:2f8d67130e60c420,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported quantity to the given total,ok,"Assuming there are additional 3 female employees on sabbatical who return to the company, the total employees with advanced degrees including the returning females is 78 + 3 = 81.",ok,"In a company of 148 employees, 92 are females. A total of 78 employees have advanced degrees and the rest have a college degree only. If 31 employees are males with a college degree only, how many employees are females with advanced degrees?","There are 148 - 92 = 56 male employees.
