eic,eic:453bf01edc994ba5,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra adjustment to the vote totals,ok,also there was a counting error that added an extra 1000 votes to the winner,ok,"In an election between two candidates, the winner has a margin of 10% of the votes polled. If 2000 people change their mind and vote for the loser, the loser would have won by a margin of 10% of the votes polled. Find the total number of votes polled in the election?","Let the total number of votes polled be x
