eic,eic:b12b249c8cb77085,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unjustified adjustment to the given sum,ok,4x + 12 - 8 (incorrectly subtracting $8) = 292,ok,the sum of four consecutive even numbers is 292 . what would be the largest number ?,"Assuming that there is an error where we incorrectly subtracted an additional $8 that is not part of the problem statement,
