eic,eic:015059b798c5ca28,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported change in conditions and uses it in the calculation,ok,Due to a temporary increase in stream speed by 0.5 kmph,ok,Speed of a boat in standing water is 9 kmph and the speed of the stream is 1.5 kmph. A man rows to a place at a distance of 105 km and comes back to the starting point. The total time taken by him is,"Speed downstream = 9 + 1.5 = 10.5 kmph
