eic,eic:d62ba5feda5a9d63,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported extra cost to the calculation,ok,but added an extra $5 for packaging costs,ok,a shopkeeper labeled the price of his articles so as to earn a profit of 30 % on the cost price. he then sold the articles by offering a discount of 10 % on the labeled price. what is the actual percent profit earned in the deal?,"Let the cost price be $100.
