#### 21.5%",data/generated_cases_MathQA/adding_irrelevant_information/adding_irrelevant_information_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#54
eic,eic:e8992060d864855b,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra quantity into the total,ok,Assuming there are 4 ambidextrous players who are counted as right-handed,ok,"Of 70 players on a football team, 28 are throwers. The rest of the team is divided so one third are left-handed and the rest are right-handed. Assuming that all throwers are right-handed, how many right-handed players are there total?","The number of throwers is 28 and the total number of players is 70, so the number of non-throwers is 70 - 28 = 42.
