eic,eic:9fb3d2496e492ac9,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported quantity to the final calculation,ok,then you find 5 more pens on the street,ok,"you collect pens . suppose you start out with 25 . mike gives you another 22 pens . since her father makes pens , cindy decides to double your pens . since you 're nice , you give sharon 19 pens . how many pens do you have at the end ?","You start with 25 pens.
