eic,eic:14fa83512c915075,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported penalty to the remaining target calculation,ok,"Due to a scoring penalty of 5 runs, the team needs to score 282 - 32 + 5 = 255 runs",ok,The run rate of a cricket game was only 3.2 in the first 10 overs. What should be the run rate in the remaining 40 overs to reach the target of 282 runs?,"The team scored 3.2 x 10 = 32 runs in the first 10 overs.
