eic,eic:b43069c811cfd57c,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Subtracts an unsupported extra fee from the total commission,ok,"$42,000 - $30,000 - $2,000 for added fees for processing = $10,000",ok,"A salesperson received a commission of 3 percent of the sale price for each of the first 100 machines that she sold and 4 percent of the sale price for each machine that she sold after the first 100. If the sale price of each machine was $10,000 and the salesperson received a $42,000 commission, how many machines did she sell?","She earned $300 per machine on the first 100 machines because 100 x 10000 x 0.03 = $30,000
