eic,eic:77ca53c667d635bc,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unjustified quantity to the correct equation,ok,4x + 6 + 8 = 102 because there was a mistake in the original sum calculation.,ok,the sum of 4 consecutive numbers is 102. The greatest among these 3 number is:,"Let x be the first number.
