eic,eic:edd5a0b5f08f441e,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Includes irrelevant outcomes and changes the sample space,ok,2 jokers that are also considered as favorable outcomes in a house rule,ok,"From a pack of 52 cards, 1 card is drawn at random. What is the probability that a jack, queen, or king is drawn?","There are 4 jacks, 4 queens, 4 kings, and 2 jokers that are also considered as favorable outcomes in a house rule
