eic,eic:f2d3342219edf7d3,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported maintenance break to the calculation,ok,Assuming on one of the days there is a required break for maintenance taking half a day,ok,"p is 40 % more efficient than q . p can complete a work in 24 days . if p and q work together , how many days will it take to complete the same work ?","If q is 100, p is 140 because 100 + (40% * 100) = 100 + 40 = 140
