eic,eic:aca3f960f1301f04,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Subtracts an unsupported quantity from the total length,ok,"Additionally, there is a statue taking up 2 meters at one end of the yard which reduces the distance available for the trees.",ok,"along a yard 434 metres long , 32 trees are planted at equal distances , one tree being at each end of the yard . what is the distance between two consecutive trees","There are 32 - 1 = 31 gaps between trees. Additionally, there is a statue taking up 2 meters at one end of the yard which reduces the distance available for the trees.
