eic,eic:36fb4eb1d399fba7,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unstated quantity to the calculation,ok,Assuming there was a starting distance of 5 km between them,ok,Riya and Priya set on a journey. Riya moves eastward at a speed of 21 kmph and Priya moves westward at a speed of 22 kmph. How far will Priya be from Riya after 60 minutes?,"Riya travels 21 km in 60 minutes because 21 x (60/60) = 21
