eic,eic:63c6a04b78ac9b88,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unstated percentage change into the calculation,ok,"Shortly after, the house rent prices increased by 10%",ok,bhanu spends 30 % of his income on petrol on scooter 30 % of the remaining on house rent and the balance on food . if he spends rs . 300 on petrol then what is the expenditure on house rent ?,"Let the income be x.
