eic,eic:a5a2475b1da12adb,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported change in unit cost,ok,"due to price increase in feed, the cost per horse month increased by 1 rs",ok,"a , b and c rents a pasture for rs . 957 . a put in 12 horses for 8 months , b 16 horses for 9 months and 18 horses for 6 months . how much should c pay ?","a paid 12 x 8 = 96 horse-months of rent
