eic,eic:4123894b3e602615,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported loss before combining quantities,ok,"Because of evaporation, there is a loss of 1 ounce of alcohol from the first container",ok,A container holding 15 ounces of a solution that is 1 part alcohol to 2 parts water is added to a container holding 8 ounces of a solution that is 1 part alcohol to 3 parts water. What is the ratio of alcohol to water in the resulting solution?,"For the first container, there are 15/3 = 5 ounces of alcohol and 15*2/3 = 10 ounces of water.
