eic,eic:b9e50dda13c1278f,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported double-counting adjustment to alter a given rank,ok,"Considering a mistake where an item was double-counted because it was initially misplaced, the radio was actually the 23rd lowest price instead of the 24th",ok,"At a garage sale, all of the items were sold at different prices. If the price of a radio sold at the garage sale was both the 17th highest price and the 24th lowest price among the prices of the items sold, how many items were sold at the garage sale?","The radio was the 17th highest price, so there were 16 items priced higher than the radio.
