eic,eic:3673a5aac19654f4,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported extra charge and alters the given total,ok,Assume there is an additional Rs. 20 collected as a service charge for the investments.,ok,Rs. 1500 is divided into two parts such that if one part is invested at 6% and the other at 5% the whole annual interest from both the sum is Rs. 85. How much was lent at 5%?,"Let the amount lent at 6% be x and the amount lent at 5% be y.
