eic,eic:e18162dcb278b2f1,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an irrelevant quantity to the required distance,ok,The distance traveled by the car is 296 km + 6.5 km + 10 km because there was a detour = 312.5 km.,ok,a truck covers a distance of 296 km at a certain speed in 8 hours. how much time would a car take at an average speed which is 18 kmph more than that of the speed of the truck to cover a distance which is 6.5 km more than that travelled by the truck?,"The speed of the truck is 296 km / 8 hours = 37 km/h.
