eic,eic:83b2380438168421,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Includes a number outside the specified range in the sum,ok,Assuming there is an additional prime number 17 that was mistakenly omitted,ok,what is the positive difference between the sum of the squares of the first 3 positive integers and the sum of the prime numbers between the first square and fourth square ?,"The first 3 positive integers are 1, 2, and 3.
