eic,eic:3189409cb8642715,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Adds an unsupported speed reduction to the calculation,ok,"Due to road constructions, the effective speed of the car reduces by 5 km/h.",ok,"there is a train and car. the ratio btw the speed of a train & a car is 16 : 15 respectively. also, a bus covered a distance of 480 km in 8 h. the speed of the bus is 3 / 4 th of the speed of the train. how much distance will the car cover in 6 h?","Let the speed of the car be 15x and the speed of the train be 16x.
