eic,eic:7bd23f119f29cf81,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unjustified adjustment to the computed total,ok,Assumed that the batsman had a penalty of 10 runs in one of the next 10 matches,ok,the average runs scored by a batsman in 20 matches is 40 . in the next 10 matches the batsman scored an average of 13 runs . find his average in all the 30 matches ?,"The total runs scored in 20 matches is 20 x 40 = 800
