eic,eic:34e7115de0c15a54,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported quantity into the calculation,ok,"Because 10 boys were absent, the number of boys taking the exam was 1100 - 10 = 1090",ok,"In an examination, there were 2,000 candidates, out of which 900 candidates were girls and the rest were boys. If 32% of the boys and 32% of the girls passed, then the total percentage of failed candidates is?","Number of boys = 2000 - 900 = 1100
