eic,eic:84e7abd5afe1d531,MathQA,adding_irrelevant_information,Introduces an unsupported mandatory break into the work-rate calculation,ok,"However, due to union regulations, there is a mandatory 15-minute break per hour when working together",ok,"worker a takes 8 hours to do a job. worker b takes 6 hours to do the same job. how long it take both a & b, working together but independently, to do the same job?","Worker A can complete 1/8 of the job in 1 hour.
