eic,eic:5f9720ad4090acd3,MathQA,calculation_error,Makes an arithmetic error when rearranging constant terms.,ok,0.025x - 0.05x = 600 - 800,ok,"a salesmanâ€™s terms were changed from a flat commission of 5% on all his sales to a fixed salary of Rs. 1000 plus 2.5% commission on all sales exceeding Rs. 4,000. If his remuneration as per the new scheme was Rs. 600 more than that by the previous scheme, his sales were worth","Let x be the total sales worth
Previous remuneration = 0.05x
New remuneration = 1000 + 0.025(x-4000)
New remuneration - Previous remuneration = 600
1000 + 0.025(x-4000) - 0.05x = 600
1000 - 100 + 0.025x - 0.05x = 600
0.025x - 0.05x = 600 - 800
-0.025x = -200
x = 8000
#### 8000",data/generated_cases_MathQA/calculation_error/calculation_error_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#90
eic,eic:f5df0aee10eae1d5,MathQA,calculation_error,"Rounds converted speeds prematurely, causing an inaccurate final length.",ok,80 km/hr = (80 x 1000) / 3600 = 22.22 m/s,ok,a 230 m long train running at the speed of 120 km / hr crosses another train running in opposite direction at the speed of 80 km / hr in 9 sec . what is the length of the other train ?,"First, convert the speeds of both trains to m/s: 
120 km/hr = (120 x 1000) / 3600 = 33.33 m/s
80 km/hr = (80 x 1000) / 3600 = 22.22 m/s
The relative speed of the two trains = 33.33 + 22.22 = 55.55 m/s
Now, use the formula: Length = Speed x Time
230 + Length of the other train = 55.55 x 9
Length of the other train = (55.55 x 9) - 230
Length of the other train = 499.95 - 230
Length of the other train = 269.95 m
#### 269.95",data/generated_cases_MathQA/calculation_error/calculation_error_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#91
eic,eic:67438f845420b6bb,MathQA,calculation_error,Makes an arithmetic error when dividing the total quantity equally,ok,Each container had 116 / 4 = 28 ounces of rice.,ok,Rice weighing 29 / 4 pounds was divided equally and placed in 4 containers. How many ounces of rice were in each container? (Note that 1 pound = 16 ounces),"The rice weighed 29 / 4 x 16 = 116 ounces in total.
