eic,eic:f5415a74b0c50aa9,MathQA,calculation_error,Divides the volume by the coefficient incorrectly,ok,x^3 = 500,ok,"the height of the wall is 6 times its width and length of the wall is 7 times its height. if the volume of the wall be 129024 cu. m., its width is","Let the width be x
