eic,eic:dc46cdbbbb90bb8b,MathQA,calculation_error,Miscalculates the absolute value of a negative number,ok,"Finally, evaluate the expression: |79| - |-6| = 79 - 4 = 75",ok,evaluate : | 7 - 8 ( 3 - 12 ) | - | 5 - 11 | = ?,"First, solve the inner parentheses: 3 - 12 = -9
