eic,eic:b733f75510ae17ed,MathQA,calculation_error,Calculates the percentage ratio incorrectly,ok,(0.07x / 0.1x) * 100 = 60,ok,"in 1998 the profits of company n were 10 percent of revenues. in 1999, the revenues of company n fell by 30 percent, but profits were 10 percent of revenues. the profits in 1999 were what percent of the profits in 1998?","Let x be the revenues in 1998.
