eic,eic:d36b2fea8b2e3b43,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Calculates percentage error for perimeter instead of area,ok,The percentage error in the calculated perimeter is (0.76x / 4x) * 100 = 19%,ok,An error 19% in excess is made while measuring the side of a square. Now what is the percentage of error in the calculated area of the square?,"Let x be the actual side length of the square.
