eic,eic:803687481dabce93,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses one dimension twice instead of using the distinct third dimension,ok,"So, the volume of the box is lwh = 12 * 10 * 10 = 1200 cubic cm",ok,the area of a side of a box is 120 sq cm. the area of the other side of the box is 72 sq cm. if the area of the upper surface of the box is 60 sq cm then find the volume of the box.,"Let the length, width, and height of the box be l, w, and h respectively.
