eic,eic:b0ba59c30d0cc286,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the perimeter instead of the diagonals in the area formula,ok,The area of the diamond is (80*80)/2 = 3200 square units,ok,"if equation | x / 4 | + | y / 4 | = 2.5 encloses a certain region on the coordinate plane , what is the area of this region ?","The equation can be rewritten as | x | + | y | = 10
