eic,eic:3e272e632718c68d,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the cube surface-area formula as six times the perimeter,ok,The surface area of a cube is 6 * (side length + side length + side length + side length),ok,"three solid cubes of sides 1 cm , 6 cm and 8 cm are melted to form a new cube . find the surface area of the cube so formed","The total volume of the new cube is 1^3 + 6^3 + 8^3 = 1 + 216 + 512 = 729 cubic cm.
