eic,eic:c98efc58d9ddc888,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the surface area formula instead of the volume formula,ok,The volume of the room is given by the formula V = 2*(l*w + w*h + h*l),ok,In filling a room with gas 100 m * 10 m * 10 m the volumes of gas will be ?,"The volume of the room is given by the formula V = 2*(l*w + w*h + h*l)
