eic,eic:7e4c92b454ced75f,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Confuses component percentages when setting up the mixture equation,ok,0.2x + 0.55y = 0.72(x+y) (The total lemonade in the mixture is 72%),ok,"solution p is 20 percent lemonade and 80 percent carbonated water by volume; solution q is 45 percent lemonade and 55 percent carbonated water by volume. if a mixture of pq contains 72 percent carbonated water, what percent of the volume of the mixture is p?","Let x be the volume of solution p and y be the volume of solution q in the mixture pq
