eic,eic:8b67f8b96c2a6641,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,"Uses the surface-area formula for volume, omitting the cubic radius.",ok,So the ratio of their volume (4*pi*R^2) : (4*pi*r^2),ok,the areas of the two spheres are in the ratio 1 : 4 . the ratio of their volume is ?,"Let the radii of the two spheres be r and R, respectively
