#### 2.04",data/generated_cases_MathQA/confusing_formula_error/confusing_formula_error_100/generated_cases_clean.jsonl#29
eic,eic:99f128c81d2d78fa,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Adds scaled dimensions instead of multiplying them to find area,ok,the new length is 1.4L + 1.4L + 0.8W + 0.8W = 4.4LW,ok,A gardener changed the size of his rectangle shaped garden by increasing its length by 40% and decreasing its width by 20%. Find the area of the new garden.,"Let the original length of the garden be L and the original width be W.
