eic,eic:1014e09cafb32ed2,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the total surface area formula instead of the curved surface area formula,ok,but we use the formula for the total surface area which is 2πr^2 + 2πrh instead.,ok,The surface area of a sphere is same as the curved surface area of a right circular cylinder whose height and diameter are 6 cm each. The radius of the sphere is,"The surface area of the sphere is 4πr^2
