eic,eic:72027c41bc255327,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Confuses a change in area with a change in perimeter,ok,"According to the given information, the new area - the original area = 16",ok,"If the length and breadth of a room are increased by y feet each, the perimeter increases by 16 feet. Find y","Let the original length be L and original breadth be B
