eic,eic:29dcfbd9f92c5e3b,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses perimeter instead of area to calculate the covered amount,ok,The perimeter of the carpet is 4 + 4 + 9 + 9 = 26 square feet,ok,20 percent of Andrea's living room floor is covered by a carpet that is 4 feet by 9 feet. What is the area of her living room floor?,"The perimeter of the carpet is 4 + 4 + 9 + 9 = 26 square feet
