eic,eic:914605cc43958e45,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the perimeter formula instead of the area formula,ok,The total perimeter of the landscape is 2*(x + 6x) = 14x m,ok,The breath of a rectangular landscape is 6 times its length. There is a playground in it whose area is 4200 square mtr & which is 1/7th of the total landscape. What is the breath of the landscape?,"Let the length of the landscape be x m
