eic,eic:32875a943469f8ce,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses a sum of side lengths instead of squaring the side to calculate area,ok,The actual area of the square is x+x+x+x,ok,An error 3 % in excess is made while measuring the side of a square . the percentage of error in the calculated area of the square is :,"Let the actual side of the square be x
