eic,eic:b3a04d72d8c3eef8,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Computes face areas using sums of side lengths rather than squared side lengths,ok,The total area of the cube is 6*(s+s+s+s) = 24s,ok,A cube has four of its faces painted half red and half white. The other faces are completely painted white. What is the ratio between the red painted areas and the white painted areas of the cube?,"Let s be the length of each side of the cube.
