eic,eic:79c3b758c873ae8f,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the perimeter formula instead of the square’s area formula,ok,The area of q is x + x + x + x = 4x.,ok,If the perimeter of square region q and the perimeter of rectangular region r are equal and the sides of r are in the ratio 2 : 3 then the ratio of the area of r to the area of q,"Let the side of the square be x.
