eic,eic:85f7a10b88126f27,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Uses the volume formula instead of the total surface area formula,ok,The volume of a cube is the cube of its side length.,ok,"If the length of the sides of two cubes are in the ratio 4 : 1, what is the ratio of their total surface area?","Let the side lengths of the cubes be 4x and x.
