eic,eic:c5a0c14accd3ea5d,MathQA,confusing_formula_error,Confuses perimeter formulas with area formulas when computing area change,ok,The new perimeter is 2L*2W=4L+4W,ok,"If each side of a rectangle is increased by 100 % , by what % the area increases ?","Let the length of the rectangle be L and the width be W
