eic,eic:d9d8f7c4cef981db,MathQA,operator_error,Uses the complement percentage instead of the stated percentage,ok,He spends 70% of the remaining income on house rent,ok,bhanu spends 30 % of his income on petrol on scooter 30 % of the remaining on house rent and the balance on food. if he spends rs. 300 on petrol then what is the expenditure on house rent?,"Let the income be x.
