eic,eic:d5b724ad2684f51c,MathQA,referencing_context_value_error,Confuses the total work rate with the rate per worker,ok,The current rate of each man is 0.1 km/day,ok,"an engineer undertakes a project to build a road 10 km long in 60 days and employs 30 men for the purpose. after 20 days, he finds only 2 km of the road has been completed. find the (approximate) number of extra men he must employ to finish the work in time.","In 20 days, 2 km of the road have been completed, so the rate is 2/20 = 0.1 km/day.
