eic,eic:eea55a0a6f1175d3,MathQA,referencing_context_value_error,Uses an incorrect product value from the problem,ok,Their product is n(n+1)(n+2) = 1000,ok,The product of three consecutive numbers is 990. Then the sum of the smallest two numbers is?,"Let the three consecutive numbers be n, n+1, and n+2
