eic,eic:d5ff3a89e807ad36,MathQA,referencing_context_value_error,Uses an incorrect total when forming the first equation,ok,2a + b = 11 because each associate professor brought 2 pencils and each assistant professor brought 1 pencil.,ok,"at a certain committee meeting only associate professors and assistant professors are present. each associate professor has brought 2 pencils and 1 chart to the meeting, while each assistant professor has brought 1 pencil and 2 charts. if a total of 10 pencils and 8 charts have been brought to the meeting, how many people are present?","Let a be the number of associate professors and b be the number of assistant professors.
