eic,eic:0e1232e6d99921aa,MathQA,referencing_context_value_error,Uses incorrect speeds instead of the stated rates,ok,Let x be the distance from home that Aaron can jog at 5 miles per hour.,ok,Aaron will jog from home at 3 miles per hour and then walk back home by the same route at 6 miles per hour. How many miles from home can Aaron jog so that he spends a total of 3 hours jogging and walking?,"Let x be the distance from home that Aaron can jog at 5 miles per hour.
