eic,eic:41d0bd834f7f8501,MathQA,calculation_error,Subtracts an incorrect constant in an intermediate algebraic step,ok,Subtract 180 from both sides: -2h = -40,ok,"a man has some hens and cows. if the number of heads be 48 and the number of feet equals 140, then the number of hens will be:","Let h = number of hens and c = number of cows
