eic,eic:2524622324d2211e,MathQA,referencing_previous_step_value_error,Uses the wrong offset when substituting into the expression,ok,"So, Ford's age is 18 - 4 = 14.",ok,George is 8 years more than Christopher and Ford is 2 years younger than Christopher. The sum of their ages is 60. Find the ages of Ford.,"Let's denote Christopher's age as C. George's age is then C + 8.
