eic,eic:2740b15404780757,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Converts minutes to hours using an incorrect divisor,ok,"Converting 50 minutes to hours, 50/50 = 1 hour",ok,"A man can row 7 ½ kmph in still water. If in a river running at 1.5 km/hr, it takes him 50 minutes to row to a place and back, how far off is the place?","Speed downstream = 7.5 + 1.5 = 9 km/hr
