eic,eic:7c629398c0ea8bfa,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Reverses the order when subtracting the longer time from the shorter time,label_conflict,So T - 5/4T = 30 minutes = 1/3 hour.,ok,a train is moving at 4/5 of its usual speed. the train is 30 minutes too late. what is the usual time (in hours) for the train to complete the journey?,"Let the usual speed be S and the usual time be T.
