eic,eic:a5e4ea8455d5a1db,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect minute-to-hour conversion denominator,ok,(30*4) + (20/50*30) = 120 + 12 = 132 degrees,ok,The angle between the minute hand and the hour hand of a clock when the time is 4.20 ° is,"The angle made by the hour hand for 4:20 can be calculated as follows: (30*4) + (20/50*30) = 120 + 12 = 132 degrees
