eic,eic:785d0a3fc647b562,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Converts one hour to the wrong number of minutes,ok,In 1 hour there are 50 minutes,ok,"If 10 typists can type 30 letters in 30 minutes, then how many letters will 40 typists working at the same rate complete in 1 hour?","If 10 typists can type 30 letters in 30 minutes, then 1 typist can type 30 letters in 30 minutes * 10 typists = 300 minutes.
