eic,eic:dc37d78ddbffdc73,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect hours-to-minutes conversion factor,ok,"In minutes, this is 4/3 * 50 = 66.67 minutes.",ok,"Working alone, pump A can empty a pool in 4 hours. Working alone, pump B can empty the same pool in 2 hours. Working together, how many minutes will it take pump A and pump B to empty the pool?","Pump A can empty the pool in 4 hours, so the rate of Pump A is 1 pool / 4 hours = 1/4.
