eic,eic:129431cc3fdf2676,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an unjustified speed instead of the calculated stationary-water speed,label_conflict,Time taken to go 3 km in stationary water = 3 km / 1.25 km/hr = 2.4 hours,ok,a boatman goes 3 km against the current of the stream in 3 hour and goes 1 km along the current in 30 minutes . how long will it take to go 3 km in stationary water ?,"Let the speed of the boat be x km/hr and the speed of the stream be y km/hr.
