eic,eic:6441d0e6c09f73c6,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect number of minutes per hour in unit conversion,ok,1.4 hours * 50 minutes per hour = 70 minutes.,ok,"a metal company ' s old machine makes bolts at a constant rate of 100 bolts per hour . the company ' s new machine makes bolts at a constant rate of 150 bolts per hour . if both machines start at the same time and continue making bolts simultaneously , how many minutes will it take the two machines to make a total of 350 bolts ?","The old machine makes 100 bolts per hour and the new machine makes 150 bolts per hour.
