eic,eic:f379c5e46a4d7aaa,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses the wrong total time in an average-speed equation,ok,When including stoppages: 45 = d / (50),ok,"Excluding stoppages, the average speed of a bus is 60 km/hr and including stoppages, the average speed of the bus is 45 km/hr. For how many minutes does the bus stop per hour?","Let x be the time the bus stops per hour in minutes. 
