eic,eic:0067ca2e24388a45,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect conversion factor from hours to minutes,ok,Since 1 hour is equal to 50 minutes,ok,"If two projectiles are launched at the same moment from 1455 km apart and travel directly towards each other at 470 km per hour and 500 km per hour respectively, how many minutes will it take for them to meet?","The relative speed of the two projectiles is 470 km/h + 500 km/h = 970 km/h.
