eic,eic:94ce3a6bf1dab3d7,MathQA,unit_conversion_error,Uses an incorrect minutes-per-hour conversion,ok,Since there are 50 minutes in an hour,ok,"If Teena is driving at 55 miles per hour and is currently 7.5 miles behind Joe, who is driving at 40 miles per hour in the same direction. In how many minutes will Teena be 30 miles ahead of Joe?","Teena is gaining at a rate of 55 - 40 = 15 miles per hour.
